# These are local-dev-only. server.js in particular starts a persistent
# http.createServer().listen() process, which is NOT a valid Vercel
# Serverless Function shape — if Vercel's zero-config detection ever picks it
# up as an entry point, invoking it crashes with FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED.
# This site is 100% static; nothing here should ever run as a function.
